{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender blenlib Module.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender blenlib Module.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender blenlib module blender blenlib module","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender blenlib Module.md","fileName":"Blender blenlib Module.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender blenlib Module","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 00:20\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Blender Library and Kernel Internals]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender BLI API","Blender blenkernel Module","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Blender blenlib Module.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Blender blenlib Module.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"blender blenlib module blender blenlib module","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Blender blenlib Module.md","fileName":"Blender blenlib Module.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Blender blenlib Module","heading":"Blender blenlib Module","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"`blenlib` is Blender's broad utility module. It provides data structures, linked lists, maps, sets, hashing, memory pools, file and path helpers, threading, timers, byte swapping, geometry algorithms, noise, random values, and mathematical operations used throughout the codebase.\n\nIts services are generally accessed through the [[Blender BLI API]]. Although many utilities are conceptually reusable outside Blender, the module still has meaningful dependencies on the surrounding repository. This distinguishes it from the more application-specific [[Blender blenkernel Module]].","tags":["baby"],"links":["Blender Library and Kernel Internals","Blender BLI API","Blender blenkernel Module","coreblenderdevelopment.pdf"],"properties":[],"page